<meiHead><fileDesc><titleStmt><title type="main">靈要操練運用魂卻</title>
<title type="subordinate">鼓勵－運用靈</title>
</titleStmt><pubStmt><identifier type="hymn">C487</identifier><identifier type="number">C487</identifier></pubStmt></fileDesc></meiHead>
<music><body><mdiv><score>
<scoreDef key.sig="2s" meter.count="4" meter.unit="4" meter.sym="common"><staffGrp><staffDef n="1" lines="5" clef.shape="G" clef.line="2"/></staffGrp></scoreDef>
<section>
<measure n="1"><staff n="1"><layer n="1">
<note xml:id="n1" pname="d" oct="4" dur="4" dots="1">
<verse n="1"><label>1.</label><syl>靈</syl></verse></note>
<note xml:id="n2" pname="d" oct="4" dur="8">
<verse n="1"><syl>要</syl></verse></note>
<note xml:id="n3" pname="e" oct="4" dur="4">
<verse n="1"><syl>操</syl></verse></note>
<note xml:id="n4" pname="b" oct="4" dur="4">
<verse n="1"><syl>練</syl></verse></note>
</layer></staff>
<harm staff="1" tstamp="1" place="above">D</harm>
<harm staff="1" tstamp="3" place="above">A</harm>
</measure>
<measure n="2"><staff n="1"><layer n="1">
<note xml:id="n5" pname="a" oct="4" dur="2">
<verse n="1"><syl>運</syl></verse></note>
<note xml:id="n6" pname="f" oct="4" dur="2">
<verse n="1"><syl>用，</syl></verse></note>
</layer></staff>
<harm staff="1" tstamp="1" place="above">D</harm>
</measure>
<measure n="3"><staff n="1"><layer n="1">
<note xml:id="n7" pname="f" oct="4" dur="4" dots="1">
<verse n="1"><syl>魂</syl></verse></note>
<note xml:id="n8" pname="f" oct="4" dur="8">
<verse n="1"><syl>卻</syl></verse></note>
<note xml:id="n9" pname="g" oct="4" dur="4" accid="s" accid.ges="s">
<verse n="1"><syl>要</syl></verse></note>
<note xml:id="n10" pname="g" oct="4" dur="4" accid.ges="s">
<verse n="1"><syl>拒</syl></verse></note>
</layer></staff>
<harm staff="1" tstamp="1" place="above">Bm</harm>
<harm staff="1" tstamp="3" place="above">E7</harm>
</measure>
<measure n="4"><staff n="1"><layer n="1">
<note xml:id="n11" pname="a" oct="4" dur="1">
<verse n="1"><syl>絕；</syl></verse></note>
</layer></staff>
<harm staff="1" tstamp="1" place="above">A</harm>
<harm staff="1" tstamp="3" place="above">A7</harm>
</measure>
<sb/>
<measure n="5"><staff n="1"><layer n="1">
<note xml:id="n12" pname="d" oct="5" dur="4" dots="1">
<verse n="1"><syl>無</syl></verse></note>
<note xml:id="n13" pname="d" oct="5" dur="8">
<verse n="1"><syl>論</syl></verse></note>
<note xml:id="n14" pname="a" oct="4" dur="4">
<verse n="1"><syl>生</syl></verse></note>
<note xml:id="n15" pname="a" oct="4" dur="4" accid="s" accid.ges="s">
<verse n="1"><syl>活</syl></verse></note>
</layer></staff>
<harm staff="1" tstamp="1" place="above">D/F♯</harm>
<harm staff="1" tstamp="3" place="above">D</harm>
</measure>
<measure n="6"><staff n="1"><layer n="1">
<note xml:id="n16" pname="b" oct="4" dur="2">
<verse n="1"><syl>行</syl></verse></note>
<note xml:id="n17" pname="b" oct="4" dur="2">
<verse n="1"><syl>動，</syl></verse></note>
</layer></staff>
<harm staff="1" tstamp="1" place="above">G</harm>
<harm staff="1" tstamp="3" place="above">Em</harm>
</measure>
<measure n="7"><staff n="1"><layer n="1">
<note xml:id="n18" pname="a" oct="4" dur="4" dots="1">
<verse n="1"><syl>以</syl></verse></note>
<note xml:id="n19" pname="f" oct="4" dur="8">
<verse n="1"><syl>此</syl></verse></note>
<note xml:id="n20" pname="g" oct="4" dur="4">
<verse n="1"><syl>為</syl></verse></note>
<note xml:id="n21" pname="e" oct="4" dur="4">
<verse n="1"><syl>祕</syl></verse></note>
</layer></staff>
<harm staff="1" tstamp="1" place="above">D/A</harm>
<harm staff="1" tstamp="3" place="above">A7</harm>
</measure>
<measure n="8" right="end"><staff n="1"><layer n="1">
<note xml:id="n22" pname="d" oct="4" dur="1">
<verse n="1"><syl>訣。</syl></verse></note>
</layer></staff>
<harm staff="1" tstamp="1" place="above">D</harm>
<harm staff="1" tstamp="2" place="above">G/D</harm>
<harm staff="1" tstamp="3" place="above">D</harm>
</measure>
</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>靈要操練運用，</l><l>規條要棄絕；</l><l>恩膏塗抹順從，</l><l>時刻無間歇。</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>靈要操練運用，</l><l>己意要拒絕；</l><l>活在生命光中，</l><l>讓主作一切。</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>靈肯操練運用，</l><l>魂肯全拒絕，</l><l>就能讚美、稱頌，</l><l>問題全解決。</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>靈肯操練運用，</l><l>主就有出路；</l><l>靈肯操練運用，</l><l>我就享豐富。</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>靈肯操練運用，</l><l>主就能摸到；</l><l>靈肯操練運用，</l><l>我就被建造。</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>靈要操練運用，</l><l>這是主所要；</l><l>靈肯操練運用，</l><l>主就得榮耀。</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
